{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34029","headline":"伤开元观顾道士 · 皮日休","name":"伤开元观顾道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"协晨宫上啓金扉，诏使先生坐蜕归。\n鹤有一声应是哭，丹无余粒恐潜飞。\n烟凄玉笥封云篆，月惨琪花葬羽衣。\n肠断雷平旧游处，五芝无影草微微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}